कादम्ब m. a kind of goose;
 n. the flower of the Kādamba
tree.

कदा॑ adv. when? at what time? how? With न never;
 w.
चन the same or at some time, once;
 w. चिद् some time or other,
sometimes, perhaps;
 w. अपि (later) at any time, always, ever. कदा
चिद्, कदा चिदपि, & कदापि w. न never.

क॑द्रु a. tawny, reddish-brown. f. कद्रू॑ a cert.
Soma-vessel;
 N. of the mythol mother of serpents (also कद्रु).

कादम्बरी f. a cert. spirituous liquor;
 N. of the
heroine of Bana's novel and the novel itself.
